      "extract": "arXiv:math/0603217v3 [math.GT] 15 Apr 2006 A VERSION OF THE VOLUME CONJECTURE HITOSHI MURAKAMI Abstract. We propose a version of the volume conjecture that would relate a certain limit of the colored Jones polynomials of a knot to the volume function deﬁned by a representation of the fundamental group of the knot complement to the special linear group of degree two over complex numbers. We also conﬁrm the conjecture",
